{"id":"1cb1491fbbaff37d","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-diffeomorphism.md","title":"Diffeomorphism","display":"df-diffeomorphism — Diffeomorphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-diffeomorphism","aliases":["58-df-diffeomorphism","Diffeomorphism"],"display":"df-diffeomorphism — Diffeomorphism","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-diffeomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-diffeomorphism</span><span>Diffeomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-diffeomorphism — Diffeomorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md\">../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md\">../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,m)\">\\(\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,m)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(N,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(N,n)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md\">../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in{}^M N\">\\(F\\in{}^M N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(F,M,N)\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(F,M,N)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md\">../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md</a>）</li>\n<li>恒等映射在断言中直接展开为相应载体上的对角函数图</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diffeomorphism} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S(F,M,N,m,n)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,m)\\land\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(N,n)\\land\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(F,M,N)\\land\\exists G\\in{}^N M\\;\\left(\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(G,N,M)\\land G\\circ F=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in M\\}\\land F\\circ G=\\{\\langle y,y\\rangle:y\\in N\\}\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diffeomorphism} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S(F,M,N,m,n)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,m)\\land\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(N,n)\\land\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(F,M,N)\\land\\exists G\\in{}^N M\\;\\left(\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(G,N,M)\\land G\\circ F=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in M\\}\\land F\\circ G=\\{\\langle y,y\\rangle:y\\in N\\}\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Diffeomorphism: smooth bijection with smooth inverse</li>\n<li>光滑流形调用改为上游二元签名，恒等映射展开为其函数图；转门沿用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S\\)</span> 的显式元理论边界。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^k\">\\(C^k\\)</span> diffeomorphism: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F, F^{-1}\">\\(F, F^{-1}\\)</span> are <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^k\">\\(C^k\\)</span></li>\n<li>Submersion: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"dF\">\\(dF\\)</span> surjective at every point</li>\n<li>Theorem: no diffeomorphism between manifolds of different dimension</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lee, Introduction to Smooth Manifolds</li>\n<li>Warner, Foundations of Differentiable Manifolds</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"d87c5d842ade903d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"71fe0dc4c8613e69","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"71fe0dc4c8613e69","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,m)$ 与 $\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(N,n)$（see [[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"d87c5d842ade903d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F\\in{}^M N$ 且 $\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(F,M,N)$（see [[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(N,n)","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in{}^M N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(F,M,N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diffeomorphism} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S(F,M,N,m,n)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,m)\\land\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(N,n)\\land\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(F,M,N)\\land\\exists G\\in{}^N M\\;\\left(\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(G,N,M)\\land G\\circ F=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in M\\}\\land F\\circ G=\\{\\langle y,y\\rangle:y\\in N\\}\\right)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"C^k","display":false},{"tex":"F, F^{-1}","display":false},{"tex":"C^k","display":false},{"tex":"dF","display":false}],"bytes":1602,"backlinks":[{"id":"1b06c1162d3facfd","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S(\\phi,B,B',2,2)$（see [[58-df-diffeomorphism]]）"},{"id":"e4a27d7be1b49de0","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"66ba1e952f22cdd1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S(F,M,S^3,3,3)$ is the predicate from [[58-df-diffeomorphism]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-422","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-diffeomorphism.md|58-df-diffeomorphism]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["d87c5d842ade903d","71fe0dc4c8613e69"]}